sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Handler as OrderHandler
    participant Service as OrderService<br/>@DataScope
    participant Aspect as DataScopeAspect
    participant Provider as DataScopeProvider
    participant Context as DataScopeContext
    participant Interceptor as DataScopeInterceptor<br/>(MyBatis-Plus)
    participant MySQL as MySQL 8.x
    
    Note over Client,MySQL: 数据权限自动过滤流程
    
    Client->>Handler: GET /admin-api/v1/orders?page=1
    activate Handler
    
    Handler->>Service: pageOrders(page, size)
    Note right of Handler: 方法标注@DataScope
    activate Service
    
    Service->>Aspect: AOP拦截
    activate Aspect
    Note right of Aspect: @Around切面
    
    Aspect->>Provider: getDataScope()
    activate Provider
    Note right of Provider: 获取当前用户<br/>数据权限范围
    
    Provider->>Context: 查询用户角色权限
    activate Context
    Note over Context: 1.全部数据权限<br/>2.本部门数据<br/>3.本部门及以下<br/>4.仅本人数据<br/>5.自定义部门
    Context-->>Provider: DataScopeInfo
    deactivate Context
    
    Provider-->>Aspect: 权限类型+可见部门列表
    deactivate Provider
    
    Aspect->>Context: DataScopeContext.set(info)
    Note right of Aspect: ThreadLocal存储
    
    Aspect->>Service: proceed()继续执行
    deactivate Aspect
    
    Service->>Interceptor: MyBatis拦截器执行
    activate Interceptor
    Note right of Interceptor: beforeQuery拦截
    
    Interceptor->>Context: DataScopeContext.get()
    Context-->>Interceptor: DataScopeInfo
    
    alt 全部数据权限
        Interceptor->>Interceptor: 不注入过滤条件
    else 本部门数据权限
        Interceptor->>Interceptor: 注入WHERE dept_id = 100
    else 本部门及以下
        Interceptor->>Interceptor: 注入WHERE dept_id IN (100,101,102)
    else 仅本人数据权限
        Interceptor->>Interceptor: 注入WHERE user_id = 123
    else 自定义数据权限
        Interceptor->>Interceptor: 注入WHERE dept_id IN (100,105)
    end
    
    Interceptor->>MySQL: SELECT * FROM sys_order<br/>WHERE ... AND dept_id IN (100,101)
    activate MySQL
    MySQL-->>Interceptor: 过滤后的结果集
    deactivate MySQL
    
    Interceptor-->>Service: List<Order>
    deactivate Interceptor
    
    Service->>Context: DataScopeContext.clear()
    Note right of Service: 清理ThreadLocal
    
    Service-->>Handler: PageResponse<OrderDTO>
    deactivate Service
    
    Handler-->>Client: 200 OK + 分页数据
    deactivate Handler
    
    Note over Client,MySQL: 关键要点
    Note over Aspect: AOP切面在方法执行前<br/>将权限信息存入ThreadLocal
    Note over Interceptor: MyBatis拦截器自动改写SQL<br/>业务代码无感知
    Note over Context: 请求结束后必须清理<br/>防止ThreadLocal泄漏
